licy":"all","topics":["agent-fleet","agent-harness","agentfield","agentic-coding","ai","ai-coding","cli-agent","coding-agent","coding-agents","coding-assistant","coding-cli","coding-harness","developer-tools","harness","harness-engineering","llm","open-models","open-source-models","software-factory","terminal-agent"],"visibility":"public","forks":14,"open_issues":141,"watchers":116,"default_branch":"dev","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"Split from #1295 (closed as superseded); this is the tracking issue for the reorganization. The approved tree, its naming sources and its placement rules are the [hierarchy comment on #1295](https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1295#issuecomment-5751311454).\n\nChildren:\n\n- #1300 - search: space-key fix and the fzf v2 matcher (in flight)\n- #1301 - one approval vocabulary across all five surfaces\n- #1299 - keybindings: page-dependent ? overlay and customization\n- #1302 - project-layer precedence and the badge/gate contradiction\n- the re-tab itself, tracked here\n\n## The shape\n\n- Nine standard-named nodes, depth two: Models & Providers, Permissions, Budget, Context & Memory, Tasks, Workspace, Appearance, Connections, General. Subgroups only where scanning would fail (Permissions, Models & Providers, General); every other node flat.\n- The panel opens on search; tabs become facets. Default view is the working set (about a dozen rows); every row stays reachable behind search and an all-rows toggle, with totality enforced by the chrome_test pattern that already fails the build when a registry key loses its tab.\n- Presets as the first row of Permissions: safe / balanced / yolo writing the trust bundle (the models.crew word is the working precedent: one word writes five tier rows).\n- The /autonomy rules live under Permissions as \"Questions while you are away\"; the ssh quartet moves to General > System; the countdowns inline under the rows they govern.\n\nEvidence: audit-notes/settings-inventory.md (all 77 rows on this branch, 81 on dev, per-tab tables, the twelve label mismatches, and the naming collisions the re-tab dissolves) on feat/1089-custom-connections.\n\n—\n\n<sub>Co-Authored-By: [codeaf](https://agentfield.ai/github?utm_source=github&utm_medium=issue&utm_campaign=drafted_with) <agentfield-bot@users.noreply.github.com></sub>\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1303/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1303/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-20T17:22:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T17:22:38Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1295","repository_url"