pos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-05T16:00:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T17:31:44Z","pushed_at":"2026-09-23T18:02:56Z","git_url":"git://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF","homepage":"http://agentfield.ai/","size":196153,"stargazers_count":116,"watchers_count":116,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":14,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":141,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["agent-fleet","agent-harness","agentfield","agentic-coding","ai","ai-coding","cli-agent","coding-agent","coding-agents","coding-assistant","coding-cli","coding-harness","developer-tools","harness","harness-engineering","llm","open-models","open-source-models","software-factory","terminal-agent"],"visibility":"public","forks":14,"open_issues":141,"watchers":116,"default_branch":"dev","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"Split from #1295 (closed as superseded).\n\n## The bug\n\nIn internal/tui3/settings.go `sheetKey`, `case \"enter\", \" \", \"space\"` activates the row, and the default text branch refuses `\" \"`: while a search is live, pressing space never reaches the query box and instead toggles or cycles the setting under the cursor. `placeSettings.owns` never claims the space for the search box, so nothing else can save it. One space, mid-search, silently changes a real setting.\n\n## The matcher\n\nSix quick-search surfaces match with substring or bare subsequence, no ranking, no multi-word, no typo tolerance: the settings sheet (`settingMatches`, `roleMatches`), the autonomy rows (settingsautonomy.go:120), connections (`connMatch`), memory (`memoryWordsMatch`), folder search (foldersearch.go:248), and the rewind sheet (rewindsheet.go:512). The model picker's token ladder is a seventh convention. Intent queries (\"yolo\", \"auto approve\") find nothing anywhere, on any surface.\n\n## The fix (in flight)\n\n`internal/fuzzy`: a port of fzf's FuzzyMatchV2 (modified Smith-Waterman with boundary and consecutive bonuses) with nucleo's documented corrections (two-matrix optimality, slab, prefilter), multi-term AND so spaces become part of the query, smart-case, one scorer for every quick-search surface, and the space-key fix so space types while search is live. The branch will be linked here when it merges.\n\nEvidence: the original writeup is section 1 of #1295; the surface inventory is audit-notes/settings-inventory.md on feat/1089-custom-connections.\n\n—\n\n<sub>Co-Authored-By: [codeaf](https://agentfield.ai/github?utm_source=github&utm_medium=issue&utm_campaign=drafted_with) <agentfield-bot@users.noreply.github.com></sub>\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1300/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1300/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]